      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong><span class=\"word\">Complete</span> <span class=\"word\">the</span> <span class=\"word\">conversation.</span> <span class=\"word\">Use</span> <span class=\"word\">possessive</span> <span class=\"word\">adjectives.</span></strong></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">A: Could I borrow <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.1</label><input id='fbo-316297-0' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='0' name='fbo-316297-0' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-0' /></span> CD player, please?&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">B: I'm sorry. <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.2</label><input id='fbo-316297-1' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='1' name='fbo-316297-1' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-1' /></span> headphones are broken. You can borrow <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.3</label><input id='fbo-316297-2' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='2' name='fbo-316297-2' type='text' size='4' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-2' /></span> MP3 player if you like.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">A: No, thanks. I want to listen to this CD. Richard and I are learning a song from it for <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.4</label><input id='fbo-316297-3' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='3' name='fbo-316297-3' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-3' /></span> gig next month.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">B: Oh, right. How's <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.5</label><input id='fbo-316297-4' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='4' name='fbo-316297-4' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-4' /></span> band?</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">A: It's great, thanks. I like playing with Richard.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">B: Matt, Dylan, and Kimberley have a band now, too.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">A: Really? Are they good?&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">B: <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.6</label><input id='fbo-316297-5' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='5' name='fbo-316297-5' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-5' /></span> songs are all right. Kimberley sings, and she's great! <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.7</label><input id='fbo-316297-6' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='6' name='fbo-316297-6' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-6' /></span> voice is fabulous! Matt doesn't play brilliantly - or <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.8</label><input id='fbo-316297-7' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='7' name='fbo-316297-7' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-7' /></span> guitar isn't very good.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"word\">A: <span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.9</label><input id='fbo-316297-8' class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='8' name='fbo-316297-8' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-316297-8' /></span> guitar isn't very good either, but I can't buy a new one.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 575px; top: 258.128px;\" id=\"gtx-trans\">\n<div class=\"gtx-trans-icon\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
