      "questionName": "141",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the text with correct possessive adjectives.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dear James,</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thanks for <span class='fillblank-option'><label>19.1</label><input id='fbo-446826-0' class='ms fillblank-option-19' index='0' name='fbo-446826-0' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-446826-0' /></span> email. It was very nice to have news from you. I was very happy to hear that you passed the exam with high scores. How did your parents react when you gave them the news? I really want to know <span class='fillblank-option'><label>19.2</label><input id='fbo-446826-1' class='ms fillblank-option-19' index='1' name='fbo-446826-1' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-446826-1' /></span> feelings. Are they happy?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">By the way, do you remember that I wanted a dog? I already have one. It's a really cute little dog that I found in the street. <span class='fillblank-option'><label>19.3</label><input id='fbo-446826-2' class='ms fillblank-option-19' index='2' name='fbo-446826-2' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-446826-2' /></span> name is Max. Sara and I found him under our car on a really cold winter day and we decided to raise that adorable dog right away. We are so happy with <span class='fillblank-option'><label>19.4</label><input id='fbo-446826-3' class='ms fillblank-option-19' index='3' name='fbo-446826-3' type='text' size='5' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-446826-3' /></span> new pet! Max has quickly become one more member of the family.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Well, I hope to see you soon, James. Please call me if you need any help.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Love,<br>Samuel.</p>",
